UI framework: React or similar for panels/dials/controls.
2. Mapping panels to components
UniverseCanvas
Renders nodes/edges and field overlays.
Subscribes to state updates via WebSocket.
TimeDial
Circular control; emits onTimeChange(t) events.
Calls backend to step or jump.
RuleComposerPanel
UI to define local patterns and transforms.
Sends rule definitions to backend as JSON; backend compiles to ReversibleRule.
KeyGlyphBoard
Shows glyphs for time indices and keys.
Clicking glyph triggers time jump.
LensSelector
Toggles rendering modes in UniverseCanvas.
SculptTools
Mouse interactions on canvas send “edit” commands to backend (field changes, topology edits).
3. Data flow
User moves time dial:
Frontend sends step_forward / step_backward or jump_to(t) to backend.
Backend updates UniverseController.state.
Backend pushes new state snapshot to frontend.
Canvas re‑renders.
User edits rules in RuleComposer:
Frontend sends rule spec.
Backend builds/updates ReversibleRule instances.
Engine’s rule list is updated.
User sculpts field/topology:
Frontend sends edit commands (e.g., “set phi[node]=x”).
Backend mutates UniverseState directly (or via reversible edit rules).
New state broadcast.
4. Minimal API sketch (backend)
# api.py
from fastapi import FastAPI
from pydantic import BaseModel
from typing import Any
from core.evolution import EvolutionEngine, UniverseController
from core.state import UniverseState
from domain.unified_field import UnifiedFieldConfig, UnifiedFieldInitializer, UnifiedFieldRule
from core.keys import KeySchedule

app = FastAPI()

# Global (for prototype)
controller: UniverseController | None = None


class StepRequest(BaseModel):
    direction: str  # "forward" or "backward"
    steps: int = 1


class StateResponse(BaseModel):
    time_index: int
    fields: dict[str, dict[int, Any]]


@app.on_event("startup")
def startup():
    global controller
    # build simple topology and unified-field universe
    from core.state import Topology
    nodes = {0, 1, 2, 3}
    edges = {0: {1}, 1: {0, 2}, 2: {1, 3}, 3: {2}}
    topo = Topology(nodes=nodes, edges=edges)

    config = UnifiedFieldConfig()
    init = UnifiedFieldInitializer(config)
    state = init.initialize_state(topo)

    key_schedule = KeySchedule(seed=123)
    rules = [UnifiedFieldRule(config)]
    engine = EvolutionEngine(rules, key_schedule)
    controller = UniverseController(state, engine)


@app.post("/step", response_model=StateResponse)
def step(req: StepRequest):
    global controller
    if req.direction == "forward":
        controller.forward(req.steps)
    else:
        controller.backward(req.steps)
    return serialize_state(controller.state)


@app.get("/state", response_model=StateResponse)
def get_state():
    global controller
    return serialize_state(controller.state)


def serialize_state(state: UniverseState) -> StateResponse:
    fields = {
        name: field.values for name, field in state.fields.items()
    }
    return StateResponse(time_index=state.time_index, fields=fields)


